User story: I want a shopping app where I can add thigns to my cart and checkout once I am done picking 
all the items I want to purchase. I want to be able to browse the different items available through 
different filters and categories and also want to be able to search for specific things I want. I need 
to be able to pay online through the app and also create an account that I can use and log in to in the 
future. 